</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      JAXRS application are not CDI beans but that&#39;s the way CXF CDI integration gets the application - this is a nice feature.<br/>
<br/>
It implies the application will rarely be normal-scope so it needs to release its creational context created at org.apache.cxf.cdi.JAXRSCdiResourceExtension#load<br/>
<br/>
This should be done in BeforeShutdown container event I think.
  </td>
