                <tr id="issuerow13016210" rel="13016210" data-issuekey="CXF-7114" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7114" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7114">CXF-7114</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Disable HTTP TRACE method on CXF http-jetty transport
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Joe Luo
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Joe Luo
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Oct/16 17:13 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Mar/17 17:24 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Nov/16 16:34 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.9,                     3.0.12,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We had a security scan and found that standalone CXF endpoint using http-jetty transport still had HTTP TRACE method enabled. It is considered as a security risk. <br/>
<br/>
It&#39;s not a problem if the CXF http-jetty transport is used with Pax Web as Pax Web had already had it&#39;s embedded Jetty engine&#39;s HTTP TRACE method disabled by default. <br/>
<br/>
So we should disable HTTP TRACE method in JettyHTTPHandler. Please find attached patch.txt for more detail.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
