                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      See line 118 in OauthJSONProvider :<br/>
appendJsonPair(sb, &quot;iss&quot;, obj.getIss(), false);<br/>
<br/>
it should be <br/>
appendJsonPair(sb, &quot;iss&quot;, obj.getIss(), true );<br/>
<br/>
in my opinion since the issuer typically is a uri.
  </td>
