<br/>
<br/>
Looks to me that the incoming Swa/Multipart message is not parsed correctly, or the indeces of the message parts are not set correctly upon extraction.<br/>
<br/>
The incoming multipart/related message looks correct to me and I&#39;m trying to attach a sample to this ticket<br/>

