                                            <td class="description">      As wrote in https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7138<br/>
<br/>
AbstractLoggingInterceptor may be configured for skipping logging binary content in multipart message, but when set, it will not log SOAP.<br/>
<br/>
It would be nice to have an option to disable logging binary attachment, but preserve logging SOAP message.
