                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Im using OIDC Dynamic Reg to register an implicit flow client.<br/>
<br/>
I get an NPE when I send this JSON :<br/>
{  <br/>
   &quot;client_name&quot;:&quot;IAM UI&quot;,<br/>
   &quot;token_endpoint_auth_method&quot;:&quot;client_secret_basic&quot;,<br/>
   &quot;redirect_uris&quot;: [ &quot;http://localhost:7070/callback&quot; ], <br/>
   &quot;grant_types&quot;:[  <br/>
      &quot;implicit&quot;<br/>
   ]<br/>
} <br/>
<br/>
The NPE is generated because clientSecret attribute of ClientRegistrationResponse is null.<br/>
<br/>
Otherwise dynamic registration works fine with default grant_types.<br/>
