                <tr id="issuerow13025274" rel="13025274" data-issuekey="CXF-7162" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7162" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7162">CXF-7162</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Inconsistent reading of formatted xml when validating schema
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Rodrigo Merino
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Rodrigo Merino
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/Dec/16 01:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Mar/17 17:24 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Dec/16 17:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.18,                     3.1.8            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.9,                     3.0.12            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When calling StaxUtils.copy() with a source reader that is validating schema, the spaces between tags used for formatting the XML are not copied to the output.<br/>
This causes, when used, the soap body signature validation to fail when using schema validation.<br/>
<br/>
I have already reported this to woodstox (https://github.com/FasterXML/woodstox/issues/29) but anyway, StaxUtils.copy() should be aware of both situations (CHARACTERS AND SPACES).
  </td>
