                <tr id="issuerow13025965" rel="13025965" data-issuekey="CXF-7166" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7166" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7166">CXF-7166</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NullPointerException at org.apache.cxf.common.jaxb.JAXBUtils.createJAXBContextProxy with IBM-JDK 8
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Rebecca Searls
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Rebecca Searls
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Dec/16 13:42 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 15/Mar/17 18:48 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Dec/16 11:16 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.7.18            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.10,                     3.0.13,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-4947                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All os<br/>
CXF in conjuction with JBoss EAP 6.4.10 and EAP 7.1.0<br/>
IBM-JDK8
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      This phenomenon occurs when Full GC happens before calling CachedContextAndSchemasInternal#getContext() in a constructor of org.apache.cxf.common.jaxb.JAXBContextCache$CachedContextAndSchemas. WeakReference&lt;JAXBContext&gt; context inside org.apache.cxf.common.jaxb.JAXBContextCache$CachedContextAndSchemasInternal is cleared at the Full GC then CachedContextAndSchemasInternal#getContext() returns null.<br/>
<br/>
This issue is reproducible with IBM-JDK 8 but not with OpenJDK or Oracle JDK 8.<br/>
<br/>
ERROR [io.undertow.request] (default task-1) UT005023: Exception handling request to /jboss-servlet-wsclient/client: java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
