                <tr id="issuerow13030047" rel="13030047" data-issuekey="CXF-7197" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7197" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7197">CXF-7197</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Loop on exception during polling message on JMS queue
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jérôme Tamborini
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jérôme Tamborini
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Dec/16 08:53 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Apr/17 14:54 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Apr/17 11:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JMS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      CXF 3.1.4, Weblogic 12c, Soap over JMS
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi, <br/>
<br/>
when an exception occurs (in my case JMSSecurityException) during PollingMessageListenerContainer$Poller#run(), it loops at CPU speed and write exception stacktrace in log. This makes the logfile grows very fast and can make the hard drive full on server.<br/>
I can propose a PR (If I got the rights on Fisheye) which is working with the commit related to CXF-6742.
  </td>
