                <tr id="issuerow13031097" rel="13031097" data-issuekey="CXF-7200" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7200" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7200">CXF-7200</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wadl2java does not see generated classes with jaxb:nameXmlTransform 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Vjacheslav Borisov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Vjacheslav Borisov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Dec/16 13:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 31/Mar/17 19:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Feb/17 02:10 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.9            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      wadl2java does not see generated classes with jaxb:nameXmlTransform enabled <br/>
<br/>
E.g. If i want to add suffix DTO to all generated classes, wadl2java stops finding them<br/>
Example config <br/>
&lt;jaxb:schemaBindings&gt;<br/>
        &lt;jaxb:nameXmlTransform&gt;<br/>
            &lt;jaxb:elementName suffix=&quot;DTO&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;jaxb:typeName suffix=&quot;DTO&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;jaxb:anonymousTypeName suffix=&quot;DTO&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/jaxb:nameXmlTransform&gt;    <br/>
    &lt;/jaxb:schemaBindings&gt;    <br/>
<br/>
Without this setting i see generated  method<br/>
...<br/>
    Test list();<br/>
...<br/>
With this setting expected to see <br/>
    TestDTO  list();<br/>
but I see <br/>
Response list();<br/>
<br/>
This is example project <br/>
https://github.com/slavb18/namexmltransform<br/>
<br/>
schemas here  https://github.com/slavb18/namexmltransform/tree/master/src/main/resources/schemas/test
  </td>
