                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m using Apache CXF to create a Jax WS Soap Webservice with Spring.<br/>
http://cxf.apache.org/docs/writing-a-service-with-spring.html<br/>
<br/>
However, the Autowired components does not work, on the Endpoint classes, it is null.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
As stated here, you can declare each Soap WS on a XML file.<br/>
http://stackoverflow.com/questions/10456119/spring-bean-not-injected-into-cxf-web-service-why<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
But I&#39;m using Spring Boot, so I don&#39;t have a web.xml file.<br/>
Is there a way to configure it on code only?<br/>

