                <tr id="issuerow13037325" rel="13037325" data-issuekey="CXF-7225" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7225" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7225">CXF-7225</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Security demos throw SocketTimeoutException
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Guopu Wu
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Guopu Wu
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Jan/17 10:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Jan/17 11:03 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Jan/17 11:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.12            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Samples,                     STS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux RedHat7.2/JDK8
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Couple of cxf 3.0.12 security demos are throwing following similar exception on Linux with JDK 8<br/>
e.g this is STS demo client -<br/>
<br/>
client:<br/>
     [java] Invoking greetMe...<br/>
     [java] Jan 19, 2017 4:54:43 PM org.apache.cxf.phase.PhaseInterceptorChain doDefaultLogging<br/>
     [java] WARNING: Interceptor for {http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512/}SecurityTokenService#{http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-sx/ws-trust/200512/}Issue has thrown exception, unwinding now<br/>
     [java] org.apache.cxf.interceptor.Fault: Could not send Message.<br/>
     [java]       at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.MessageSenderInterceptor$MessageSenderEndingInterceptor.handleMessage(MessageSenderInterceptor.java:64)<br/>
     [java]       at org.apache.cxf.phase.PhaseInterceptorChain.doIntercept(PhaseInterceptorChain.java:307)<br/>
     [java]       at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.doInvoke(ClientImpl.java:516)<br/>
     [java]       at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(ClientImpl.java:425)<br/>
     [java]       at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(ClientImpl.java:326)<br/>
     [java]       at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(ClientImpl.java:279)<br/>
