</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF has a lot of pi.getProvider().getClass() usages but it breaks when using proxies not propagating annotations (@Priority - org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.provider.ServerProviderFactory.ServerConfigurationImpl#getPriority, name bindings org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.provider.ProviderFactory#getFilterNameBindings, etc)<br/>
<br/>
Using at least org.apache.cxf.common.util.ClassHelper would solve this (and this API is designed for it isnt it?). Also using ClassUnwrapper would be consistent.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
