cxf 2.7.13
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I access localhost:8181/cxf?_wadl, all the the endpoints are listed out. I tried setting property org.apache.cxf.endpoint.private to true in blueprint.xml, but still the cxf generated wadl file is accessible.Here is the config<br/>
<br/>
&lt;jaxrs:server id=&quot;edisc&quot; address=&quot;/cxf&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;jaxrs:serviceBeans&gt;<br/>
			&lt;ref component-id=&quot;applicationWebService&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/jaxrs:serviceBeans&gt;<br/>
		&lt;jaxrs:providers&gt;<br/>
			&lt;ref component-id=&quot;jsonProvider&quot; /&gt;	<br/>
		&lt;/jaxrs:providers&gt;<br/>
		&lt;jaxrs:properties&gt;<br/>
			&lt;entry key=&quot;org.apache.cxf.endpoint.private&quot; value=&quot;true&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/jaxrs:properties&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/jaxrs:server&gt;<br/>

  </td>
