                                            <td class="environment">      java 8
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using AutoRedirect=true with cxf-rt-transports-http-hc the call is  correctly executed asynchronously through httpasyncclient BUT the original thread blocks until the end of the asynchronous execution. <br/>
<br/>
Switching AutoRedirect to false make the same call fully asynchronous by avoiding work in org.apache.cxf.transport.http.HTTPConduit.WrappedOutputStream.handleRetransmits()
  </td>
