                                            <td class="description">      There is a bug in the JDK (&gt; 8u65) that will be fixed in 8u152:<br/>
<br/>
https://bugs.openjdk.java.net/browse/JDK-8144566<br/>
<br/>
 There is a TLS handshake failure when a default HostnameVerifier is specified. There is a trivial workaround though to mitigate this issue.
