    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7236" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7236">CXF-7236</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAXRSInInterceptor throw java.lang.IndexOutOfBoundsException if Accept header is empty
    </p>
</td>
