                <tr id="issuerow13039826" rel="13039826" data-issuekey="CXF-7240" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7240" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7240">CXF-7240</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAX-WS Dispatch incorrectly asserts that Message mode with XML/HTTP binding is invalid when using instances of DataSource
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Liam H
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Liam H
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Feb/17 13:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Apr/17 19:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Feb/17 06:53 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.7,                     3.1.10            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.0.13,                     3.1.11,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If a instance of dispatch is created in the following way:<br/>
<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
    QName serviceName = new QName(&quot;http://org.apache.cxf&quot;, &quot;stockQuoteReporter&quot;);<br/>
    Service s = Service.create(serviceName);<br/>
 <br/>
    QName portName = new QName(&quot;http://org.apache.cxf&quot;, &quot;stockQuoteReporterPort&quot;);<br/>
    Dispatch&lt;ByteDataSource&gt; dispatch = s.createDispatch(portName,<br/>
                                                         ByteDataSource.class,<br/>
                                                         Service.Mode.MESSAGE);}}<br/>
{code}<br/>
then invoking the created Dispatch instance like so:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
    dispatch.invoke(new ByteDataSource(&quot;&quot;.getBytes()));<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
results in an exception with the message &quot;DataSource is not valid in MESSAGE mode with XML/HTTP binding.&quot;<br/>
<br/>
This contradicts your own documentation(and I believe the JAX-WS spec) in that these are this the only binding and mode you can use in combination with a DataSource :<br/>
{quote}<br/>
Dispatch objects can use objects that implement the javax.activation.DataSource interface when the following conditions are true:<br/>
<br/>
    the Dispatch object is using the HTTP binding.<br/>
    the Dispatch object is using message mode.<br/>
{quote}<br/>

  </td>
