  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The fix correcting the issue CXF-7213, do the follow attribution:<br/>
<br/>
Class&lt;?&gt; collCls = Collection.class.isAssignableFrom(valueType) ? valueType : returnType;<br/>
<br/>
that uses the:<br/>
org.apache.olingo.odata2.api.servicedocument.Collection<br/>
<br/>
And I&#39;m getting a crash on my app, because I&#39;m using FIQL, i&#39;m not importing any odata dependency.<br/>
<br/>
I think it should use java.utils.Collections instead. Am I right?<br/>

  </td>
