                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
Recently we migrated our application to use apache cxf 3.1.6. We are generating data through soap services. Data follows some hierarchy in POJO. All functionalities working fine in java 7 whereas in Java 8 while soap returning the data the pojo hierarchy is missing. We must use java 8 to run the application. Please let us know, if you need structure and source code reference.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks,<br/>
Marudhu<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
