                                            <td class="environment">      WebSphere 8.5.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello,<br/>
<br/>
I have contract-first jax-ws web services in which validation rules have been defined in WSDL. Using invalid SOAP payloads with SoapUI, the services aren&#39;t return faults but responses as if the payload was correct. The validation rules seem to be ignored. Is something else required in addition to simply annotated the SEI with @SchemaValidation ?<br/>
<br/>
Many thanks in advance,<br/>
Nicolas
