                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When buidling up the string representation, currently the array of read characters is copied into a string before being appended to the string buffer. With a stringbuilder it can take a char array and copy directly into it&#39;s internal buffer, avoiding the intermediate string.<br/>
<br/>
*first contribution to this, or any Apache project, so not sure if this needs to be categorised better.
