                                            <td class="description">      http://cxf.apache.org/docs/jax-ws-configuration.html<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Example xml just above the header &quot;Configuring a Spring Client (Option 1)&quot; is invalid. The interceptor tag has a typo in it, &quot;inInterceptors&quot; vs &quot;inInterceptor&quot;. <br/>
<br/>
 &lt;jaxws:inInterceptors&gt;<br/>
      &lt;bean class=&quot;com.acme.SomeInterceptor&quot;/&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ref bean=&quot;anotherInterceptor&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/jaxws:inInterceptor&gt;<br/>

  </td>
