    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7336" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7336">CXF-7336</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                [cdi] wrong org.apache.cxf.cdi.CdiResourceProvider#isSingleton implementation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andriy Redko
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Romain Manni-Bucau
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Romain Manni-Bucau
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Apr/17 09:14 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Apr/17 01:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Apr/17 01:31 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.12,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      org.apache.cxf.cdi.CdiResourceProvider#isSingleton returns &quot;is not request scoped&quot; but cdi will issue a contextual proxy for @RequestScoped instances so a @RequestScoped instance *is* a singleton.<br/>
<br/>
The implementation should be !beanManager.isNormalScope(bean.getScope()). If a normal scope (@ApplicationScoped, @RequestScoped...) then the context is managed outside the proxy and the proxy is a singleton.
  </td>
