<br/>
This might be related to JEP 143: Improve Contended Locking<br/>
<br/>
This looks similar to another user&#39;s pull request build: https://builds.apache.org/job/CXF-Trunk-PR/354/<br/>
although that build is failing on the sendMessage in java 8.
