                <tr id="issuerow13067452" rel="13067452" data-issuekey="CXF-7349" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7349" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7349">CXF-7349</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NPE in ClassLoaderUtils
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andy McCright
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andy McCright
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Apr/17 17:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Jun/17 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Jun/17 14:28 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.12,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A NullPointerException can be thrown when the JVM&#39;s boot classloader is set as the thread&#39;s context classloader.  Ex:<br/>
<br/>
URL url = Thread.currentThread().getContextClassLoader().getResource(resourceName);<br/>
<br/>
The call to getContextClassLoader() could return null - that is a valid return from that method.  In that case, we should use ClassLoader.getSystemClassLoader() instead.<br/>
<br/>
This issue was reported on in the users mailing list:<br/>
http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/NPE-in-cxf-core-ClassLoaderUtils-possible-bug-td5780007.html
  </td>
