                <tr id="issuerow13067584" rel="13067584" data-issuekey="CXF-7350" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7350" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7350">CXF-7350</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                the exception should be able to return to client if retry is 0 with ws-rm
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Apr/17 03:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Apr/17 04:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Apr/17 04:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.12,                     3.0.14,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF-2841 fix the scenario that when the ws-rm retransmission kick in the exception occured in client out interceptor shouldn&#39;t return to client. However, there&#39;s case that ws-rm retry set as 0 like<br/>
{code}<br/>
        SourcePolicyType sourcePolicy = new SourcePolicyType();<br/>
        RetryPolicyType retryP = new RetryPolicyType();<br/>
        retryP.setMaxRetries(0);<br/>
        sourcePolicy.setRetryPolicy(retryP);<br/>
        bus.getExtension(RMManager.class).setSourcePolicy(sourcePolicy);<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
In this case the exception should be able to return to client so that the client can fast fail
  </td>
