                <tr id="issuerow13069080" rel="13069080" data-issuekey="CXF-7362" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7362" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7362">CXF-7362</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                UnmarshalException: unexpected element on valid XML. After Errors limit exceeded it works
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Mark Ebbers
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Mark Ebbers
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/May/17 09:36 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/May/17 22:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/May/17 11:54 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.0.7,                     3.1.10,                     3.1.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime,                     JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      java version &quot;1.8.0_121&quot;<br/>
Java(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 1.8.0_121-b13)<br/>
Java HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (build 25.121-b13, mixed mode)<br/>
<br/>
Spring-boot: 1.4.6.RELEASE<br/>
Jersey: 2.25.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m using Apacha CXF in my spring-boot SOAP webservice application and came across a very strange bug / problem.<br/>
<br/>
I have certain SOAP requests which are valid but still throws an &#39;UnmarshalException: unexpected element (uri:&quot;&quot;, local:&quot;string&quot;). Expected elements are (none)&#39;. But if I execute this request multiple times I get the &#39;interceptor.Fault: Unmarshalling Error: Errors limit exceeded.&#39; exception and AFTER this exception the request is parsed and handled correctly!<br/>
<br/>
Also it is not with all requests. Two examples provided beneath.<br/>
<br/>
This example will trigger the exceptions and only works after the error limit<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:epcisq=&quot;urn:epcglobal:epcis-query:xsd:1&quot; xmlns:xs=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot; xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
      &lt;epcisq:Poll&gt;<br/>
         &lt;queryName&gt;SimpleEventQuery&lt;/queryName&gt;<br/>
         &lt;params&gt;<br/>
            &lt;param&gt;<br/>
               &lt;name&gt;eventType&lt;/name&gt;<br/>
               &lt;value&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;string xsi:type=&quot;epcisq:ArrayOfString&quot;&gt;<br/>
                     &lt;string xsi:type=&quot;xs:string&quot;&gt;ObjectEvent&lt;/string&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;/string&gt;<br/>
               &lt;/value&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/param&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/params&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/epcisq:Poll&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
This example works out of the box<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:epcisq=&quot;urn:epcglobal:epcis-query:xsd:1&quot; xmlns:xs=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot; xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
      &lt;epcisq:Poll&gt;<br/>
         &lt;queryName&gt;SimpleEventQuery&lt;/queryName&gt;<br/>
         &lt;params&gt;<br/>
            &lt;param&gt;<br/>
               &lt;name&gt;eventType&lt;/name&gt;<br/>
               &lt;value&gt;ObjecatEvent&lt;/value&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/param&gt;<br/>
         &lt;/params&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/epcisq:Poll&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
STACKTRACE (showing the last unexpected element and the error limit)<br/>
org.apache.cxf.interceptor.Fault: Unmarshalling Error: unexpected element (uri:&quot;&quot;, local:&quot;string&quot;). Expected elements are (none) <br/>
