                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When performing http status code handling in the incoming interceptor chain of a jaxws client, it would be useful to have access to the original message sent by the service as well.<br/>
<br/>
I will add a system property to activate this setter so that it does not have unexpected consequences for existing clients.<br/>
<br/>
I also want to expose the org.apache.cxf.transport.no_io_exceptions and org.apache.cxf.transport.process_fault_on_http_400 as static properties on HttpConduit so they can be used from client code.
  </td>
