                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
We are facing jar coflicting issues for CXF and its dependant jars. I am using Soap Web services call from application. The environment is Cloud server and App server is Websphere ND 8.5.5.9.<br/>
<br/>
I am trying to call external wsdl web services from my application and trying to get json/xml response. <br/>
The application code is working as expected in Tomcat but the same code with same set of Jars are not working in Websphere ND 8.5.5.9<br/>
I&#39;ll provide the list of jars I am using if required.<br/>

