                <tr id="issuerow13074838" rel="13074838" data-issuekey="CXF-7383" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7383" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7383">CXF-7383</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Supporting multiple end points with different bus
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tony Clarke
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tony Clarke
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/May/17 13:25 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/May/17 13:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/May/17 13:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
If we define two buses in xml configuration<br/>
<br/>
&lt;cxf:bus name=&quot;cxf-abstract-bus&quot; <br/>
		abstract=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;/cxf:bus&gt;<br/>
&lt;bean id=&quot;cxf-usernametoken&quot; abstract=&quot;true&quot; parent=&quot;cxf-abstract-bus&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;inInterceptors&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;list&gt;<br/>
				&lt;ref bean=&quot;userNameTokenInterceptor&quot; /&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/list&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/property&gt;<br/>
&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
&lt;bean id=&quot;cxf-samltokensigned&quot; abstract=&quot;true&quot; parent=&quot;cxf-abstract-bus&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;inInterceptors&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;list&gt;<br/>
				&lt;ref bean=&quot;samlTokenSignedInterceptor&quot; /&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/list&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/property&gt;<br/>
&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
&lt;bean id=&quot;cxf&quot; parent=&quot;cxf-usernametoken&quot;/&gt;<br/>
	<br/>
&lt;bean id=&quot;cxf-saml-bus&quot; parent=&quot;cxf-samltokensignaturesigned&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Now we have two endpoint definitions:<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint bus=&quot;cxf&quot;<br/>
....<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint bus=&quot;cxf-saml-bus&quot;<br/>
....<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Is it expected to work? Currently we are experiencing a situation where we can only define one bus and use it across all endpoints. 
  </td>
