                <tr id="issuerow13076504" rel="13076504" data-issuekey="CXF-7389" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7389" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7389">CXF-7389</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAXRSUtils warning logs
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Anton Johansson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Anton Johansson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Jun/17 12:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Jun/17 15:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We&#39;re running a REST API service using CXF. We&#39;ve got a dashboard with all warning and error logs that we frequently use, and this dashboard includes 404&#39;s that clients get when communicating with our API. We do not log WARN or ERROR any other errors from the 400-series, because it&#39;s in theory the clients fault and we can&#39;t do anything about it. We have now decided that we want to stop logging WARN for these 404&#39;s.<br/>
<br/>
Our issue: We don&#39;t see any possible way to disable this log (or preferably change it to INFO). It&#39;s logged from a static class, JAXRSUtils, see this line:<br/>
http://grepcode.com/file/repo1.maven.org/maven2/org.apache.cxf/cxf-bundle-jaxrs/2.7.6/org/apache/cxf/jaxrs/utils/JAXRSUtils.java#501<br/>
<br/>
We could of course change the threshold to ERROR for this class, but I don&#39;t want to lose the other INFO and WARN logs.<br/>
<br/>
I understand that this warning is great for clients, but I don&#39;t see it being very useful for servers?<br/>
<br/>
Any tips or ideas about how we can disable this warning?
  </td>
