                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-7392                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is for a regular WS-RM scenario, traffic takes place normally, and then the server disconnects. After the server restart, the client continues to send messages using the known sequence id, but the first message gets rejected (rightfully so) with the following stack:<br/>
<br/>
{code:Title=Karaf logs}<br/>
