                <tr id="issuerow13077339" rel="13077339" data-issuekey="CXF-7395" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7395" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7395">CXF-7395</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WS-Addressing issue related to WS-RM when using SoapUI
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Hadrian Zbarcea
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Hadrian Zbarcea
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Jun/17 20:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 07/Jun/17 18:13 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Jun/17 17:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.7,                     3.1.10            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.12,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using WS-RM the first out-of-band message is necessary to generate a sequence identifier. CXF WS-RM implementation uses a message of the following form (and everything works):<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
  &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
    &lt;CreateSequence xmlns=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-rx/wsrm/200702&quot; xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;AcksTo&gt;<br/>
        &lt;ns2:Address&gt;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/anonymous&lt;/ns2:Address&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/AcksTo&gt;<br/>
      &lt;Expires&gt;PT0S&lt;/Expires&gt;<br/>
      &lt;Offer&gt;<br/>
        &lt;Identifier&gt;urn:uuid:d4bbc349-7844-4ed4-b35c-de4231f2e032&lt;/Identifier&gt;<br/>
        &lt;Endpoint&gt;<br/>
          &lt;ns2:Address&gt;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/anonymous&lt;/ns2:Address&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/Endpoint&gt;<br/>
        &lt;Expires&gt;PT0S&lt;/Expires&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/Offer&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/CreateSequence&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
If other clients are used, such as SoapUI, the message is generated slightly differently:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
  &lt;soapenv:Body xmlns:wsrm=&quot;http://docs.oasis-open.org/ws-rx/wsrm/200702&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;wsrm:CreateSequence&gt;<br/>
      &lt;wsrm:AcksTo xmlns:wsa=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;wsa:Address&gt;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/anonymous?id=0cbf2f7c-0e91-49b3-90d2-68219df51735&lt;/wsa:Address&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/wsrm:AcksTo&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/wsrm:CreateSequence&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The issue is with the {{&lt;wsa:Address&gt;}} element, that is not an exact match to {{http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/anonymous}}, but it contains an extra query parameter: {{?id=0cbf2f7c-0e91-49b3-90d2-68219df51735}}.<br/>
 CXF however tests for an exact match.<br/>
<br/>
This is not a major issue, as there is an undocumented workaround to explicitly set the {{Acknowledgement to:}} field in the WS-RM field in SoapUI to the exact value of the ws-a anonymous url. However, given CXF&#39;s tradition of being strict with itself and lenient with other stacks, this is worth fixing.
  </td>
