                <tr id="issuerow13078129" rel="13078129" data-issuekey="CXF-7400" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7400" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7400">CXF-7400</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Swagger2Feature causes 404 on URIs ending with *ico
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Cody Raethke
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Cody Raethke
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Jun/17 21:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Jun/17 16:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Jun/17 16:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        3.1.12,                     3.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using the Swagger2Feature with Swagger UI, requests to paths ending in &quot;ico&quot; (such as /magnifico) are routed to Swagger UI, which causes a 404.<br/>
<br/>
The below regex in SwaggerUIResourceFilter needs to include a dot [.] before the ico extension so only files with that extension are routed to SwaggerUI<br/>
{code}<br/>
.*[.]js|/css/.*|/images/.*|/lib/.*|.*ico|/fonts/.*<br/>
{code}
  </td>
