                <tr id="issuerow13078423" rel="13078423" data-issuekey="CXF-7402" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7402" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7402">CXF-7402</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Apache CXF Policy Exception
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            piyush
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            piyush
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Jun/17 20:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 09/Jun/17 11:00 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Jun/17 11:00 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.18,                     3.1.11            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Spring Tool Suite 
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Caused by: org.apache.cxf.ws.policy.PolicyException: Reference to policy #WSHttpBinding_ICrmService_policy could not be resolved.<br/>
<br/>
I am getting this exception when calling one of the methods.<br/>
This is part of WSDL which is referencing a local policy. <br/>
&lt;wsp:Policy wsu:Id=&quot;WSHttpBinding_ICrmService_policy&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;wsp:ExactlyOne&gt;<br/>
                &lt;wsp:All&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;wsaw:UsingAddressing /&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/wsp:All&gt;<br/>
