                                            <td class="description">      The master (3.2.0-SNAPSHOT) seems to be moving towards using commons-lang3 instead of commons-lang. The cxf xjc plugin 3.1.0 is also requiring commons-lang3. However, at the moment both versions are still pulled, basically because of velocity 1.7 transitive dependencies.<br/>
It would really make sense to finish up the migration to newer commons-lang3, by also upgrading velocity from 1.7 to 2.0.
