                                            <td class="description">      As the cdi module for jaxrs it would be neat to have one for jaxws, meecrowave created one (assuming jaxrs one is there): https://github.com/apache/meecrowave/commit/1350935b2eecaba8ffee9f0df1de0912960b1cee<br/>
