                                            <td class="description">      Hi<br/>
<br/>
I am trying to run sample CXF Swagger integration available here {https://github.com/apache/cxf/tree/master/distribution/src/main/release/samples/jax_rs/description_swagger2}<br/>
There is no jar available for 3.2.0-SNAPSHOT for cxf-rt-frontend-jaxrs and cxf-rt-rs-service-description-swagger.<br/>
then I am trying run it using lower version 3.1.9 for cxf-rt-rs-service-description-swagger, but it on start up of server it is looking for org/apache/cxf/jaxrs/model/doc/DocumentationProvider class which is not there with Jar<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
