Appendix W: Implementation Material<br/>
Implementation material for ITI profiles such as XDS, XCA, RFD, and others can be found on the IHE FTP site under ftp://ftp.ihe.net/TF_Implementation_Material/ITI/.<br/>
Some of the types of implementation material available are schema, examples and informative WSDL.<br/>
#############################################<br/>
