                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Apache CXF ws-discovery 3.0.4 not working with WSO2 G-REG 5.3.0
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Test</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
