                <tr id="issuerow13082776" rel="13082776" data-issuekey="CXF-7432" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7432" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7432">CXF-7432</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JAX-RS does not work with Equinox Framework
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Setya
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Setya
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Jun/17 10:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Jun/17 10:34 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Apache Karaf 4.0.8
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi all,<br/>
<br/>
JAX-RS and Equinox framework in Karaf 4.0.8 do not seem to get along nicely.<br/>
<br/>
Below are steps to reproduce the problems:<br/>
<br/>
. Set karaf.framework=equinox in etc/config.properties <br/>
2. ./karaf clean <br/>
3. feature:install gemini-blueprint <br/>
4. feature:install cxf-dosgi-core <br/>
5. Install [^cxfdemo.jar] bundle. <br/>
6. Hit the REST service with the following request: <br/>
<br/>
POST http://&lt;Your IP&gt;:&lt;Your Port&gt;/services/rest/cxfservice/sayName HTTP/1.1 <br/>
Accept-Encoding: gzip,deflate <br/>
Content-Type: application/xml <br/>
Accept: text/plain <br/>
Content-Length: 81 <br/>
Host: localhost:8181 <br/>
Connection: Keep-Alive <br/>
User-Agent: Apache-HttpClient/4.1.1 (java 1.5) <br/>
<br/>
&lt;name&gt;<br/>
  &lt;firstName&gt;Foo&lt;/firstName&gt;<br/>
  &lt;lastName&gt;Bar&lt;/lastName&gt;<br/>
&lt;/name&gt;<br/>
<br/>
7. The response would be: <br/>
<br/>
HTTP/1.1 415 Unsupported Media Type <br/>
Date: Sat, 13 May 2017 14:29:03 GMT <br/>
Date: Sat, 13 May 2017 14:29:03 GMT <br/>
Content-Length: 0 <br/>
Server: Jetty(9.2.19.v20160908) <br/>
<br/>
8. Do the same with karaf.framework=felix -&gt; Success<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
