                                            <td class="description">      Used java 1.8.0_72, CXF 3.1.12 and javax.ws.rs-api-2.1-m09 to create a web service. There is no option to put required=&quot;true&quot; parameter for @PathParam, @FormParam etc to generate the WADL with required=&quot;true&quot; attribute<br/>
<br/>
WADL should look like below once the required=&quot;true&quot; attribute is accepted from java source.<br/>
&lt;resource path=&quot;as/{a}/bs/{b}/send&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;param name=&quot;a&quot; required=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;template&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;param name=&quot;b&quot; required=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;template&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>

