                <tr id="issuerow13088320" rel="13088320" data-issuekey="CXF-7450" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7450" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7450">CXF-7450</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                encoding of incoming JMS message not set
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andreas Vallen
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andreas Vallen
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Jul/17 08:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Jul/17 10:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        3.1.11            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      After upgrading from CXF 3.1.7 to 3.1.11, LoggingInInterceptor started failing due to the message encoding being unset for incoming messages.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
Caused by: java.lang.NullPointerException: charsetName<br/>
	at java.io.InputStreamReader.&lt;init&gt;(InputStreamReader.java:99)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.AbstractLoggingInterceptor.writePayload(AbstractLoggingInterceptor.java:180)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.LoggingInInterceptor.logInputStream(LoggingInInterceptor.java:221)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.LoggingInInterceptor.logging(LoggingInInterceptor.java:159)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.LoggingInInterceptor.handleMessage(LoggingInInterceptor.java:80)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.phase.PhaseInterceptorChain.doIntercept(PhaseInterceptorChain.java:308)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.onMessage(ClientImpl.java:801)<br/>
	at org.apache.camel.component.cxf.transport.CamelOutputStream.handleResponseInternal(CamelOutputStream.java:172)<br/>
	at org.apache.camel.component.cxf.transport.CamelOutputStream.syncInvoke(CamelOutputStream.java:120)<br/>
	at org.apache.camel.component.cxf.transport.CamelOutputStream.commitOutputMessage(CamelOutputStream.java:99)<br/>
	at org.apache.camel.component.cxf.transport.CamelOutputStream.doClose(CamelOutputStream.java:71)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.io.CachedOutputStream.close(CachedOutputStream.java:213)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.io.CacheAndWriteOutputStream.postClose(CacheAndWriteOutputStream.java:56)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.io.CachedOutputStream.close(CachedOutputStream.java:216)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.transport.AbstractConduit.close(AbstractConduit.java:56)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.interceptor.MessageSenderInterceptor$MessageSenderEndingInterceptor.handleMessage(MessageSenderInterceptor.java:62)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.phase.PhaseInterceptorChain.doIntercept(PhaseInterceptorChain.java:308)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.doInvoke(ClientImpl.java:514)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(ClientImpl.java:423)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(ClientImpl.java:324)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.endpoint.ClientImpl.invoke(ClientImpl.java:277)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.frontend.ClientProxy.invokeSync(ClientProxy.java:96)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxws.JaxWsClientProxy.invoke(JaxWsClientProxy.java:139)<br/>
	... 165 common frames omitted<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Possible cause is that {{org.apache.cxf.transport.jms.JMSMessageUtils#populateIncomingContext}} fails to set the encoding, because the message property that it looks for is {{Content-Type}}, but the message properties contain only one that is named &quot;Content_HYPHEN_Type&quot;.<br/>

  </td>
