                <tr id="issuerow13088727" rel="13088727" data-issuekey="CXF-7451" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-7451" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-7451">CXF-7451</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Outdated vulnerable dependency in cxf-rt-transports-http-jetty
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Not A Problem
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Emile Fugulin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Emile Fugulin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Jul/17 12:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Jul/17 13:26 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Jul/17 13:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
We use cxf-rt-transports-http-jetty in our project, but the latest version still depends on Jetty 9.2.21.<br/>
The problem is that jetty-http 9.2 is vulnerable: <br/>
https://blog.gdssecurity.com/labs/2015/2/25/jetleak-vulnerability-remote-leakage-of-shared-buffers-in-je.html<br/>
<br/>
You can also look at https://snyk.io/vuln/SNYK-JAVA-ORGECLIPSEJETTY-30090 for more information.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks!<br/>

  </td>
